            "line": 277,
            "text": "theorem weighted_square_release_integral_le (d : TailData) (eta : ℝ) {y : ℝ}\n    (hy : d.releaseStart ≤ y) :\n    d.h * (∫ t in Ioi y, Real.exp (t - y) * finalAngular d (t, eta) ^ 2) ≤\n      finalAngular d (y, eta) ^ 2"
